e man said he was looking for an adventurer named “Kazuma Satou.\" In exchange for dinner, Kazuma told them the legend of “Kazuma Satou,” which moved the man and his party of three female adventurers to tears...\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News, edited)\n\nNote: The anime was pre-screened in Japan theatrically for 2 weeks starting on March 14, 2025."},"tags":[{"name":"Slapstick","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Chuunibyou","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Satire","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":65,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"KONOSUBA -God's Blessing on This Wonderful World! 3 -BONUS STAGE-","english":"KONOSUBA -God's Blessing on This Wonderful World! 3 -BONUS STAGE-","native":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！３ーBONUS STAGEー","romaji":"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 3: BONUS STAGE","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"为美好的世界献上祝福！第三季 ーBONUS STAGEー"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"KonoSuba: God's Blessing on This Wonderful World! 3 Bonus Stage"}]},"trailer":{"id":"UIFjZfSZJKw","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UIFjZfSZJKw/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}